  "id": "elaboration",
  "term": "elaboration",
  "definition": "In this context, elaboration means giving fuller detail to explain and clarify guidance so trial design and reporting can better address the specific methodological, ethical, and welfare issues involved. It expands brief recommendations into more understandable, transparent guidance.",
